Copyright 2026 Aqamoe (光水)

This product includes a copy of fgb_module_api.h from FaceGaze Bridge
(https://github.com/Aqamoe/FaceGaze-Bridge), licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0. The header is resolved at build time from the release
pinned in sdk.lock.json; this repository does not contain a copy of it.

The OSC address list (45 face + 6 eye channels), the default port 8888 and the
face mapping were informed by the upstream projects Project-Babble/Baballonia
(https://github.com/Project-Babble/Baballonia, C#, MIT) and the archived
dfgHiatus/VRCFT-Babble (https://github.com/dfgHiatus/VRCFT-Babble, C#, MIT).
This repository is an independent C++ implementation of that wire format and
contains none of their source code.

Project Babble and Baballonia are projects of their respective maintainers.
This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by them.
